"This also allows parameter update and certain MAVLink commands to be sent "
"from and OpenTX transmitter to the autopilot. (See :ref:`Yaapu Bi-"
"Directional Telemetry GCS <common-yaapu-gcs>`)"
msgstr ""
"这也允许从 OpenTX 遥控器向飞控发送参数更新和某些 MAVLink 命令。（参见 :ref:`Yaapu 双向数传地面站 <common-"
"yaapu-gcs>`）"

